+def fetch_image(url: str, *, max_bytes: int, deadline: float, policy: Policy = Policy()) -> tuple[bytes, str]:
+    """(bytes, declared type) of an image URL: each hop (the URL, then every redirect) checked, resolved, its
+    addresses checked, then fetched from the checked address; everything before ``deadline`` (``time.monotonic``)."""
+
+    try:
